WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.860
And this is a MeetingScheduled

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:02.720
CRM.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.340
It's also able to connect

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.600
to HubSpot or Salesforce in

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.150
here.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.160
We can follow either on

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.030
each user

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.568
as an admin or to

00:00:13.568 --> 00:00:15.190
see your own pipeline.

00:00:16.192 --> 00:00:18.420
When we click on one

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.780
of the leads we've spoken

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.820
with, we can hear the

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:23.490
recordings.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.000
We can see the transcript

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.950
directly here,

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.530
and we can log in

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:33.360
any information that we have

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.790
new directly

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.030
in our calendar and

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.220
see how many conversations I

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.440
had, how many call recordings

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.680
and who I need to

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.750
call today.
